      "description": "<p> Get plugged into the healthcare working group at our November General Meeting</p><p>Agenda:</p><p>1) Healthcare for All resolution debrief and next steps</p><p>2) planning HCWG project connecting people to health coverage</p><p>3) Healthcare Ripoff Town Hall slides, training the trainers</p>",
